          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Mose na Aroni n’ ishengero ryose ry’Abisirayeli bagenjeje ku Balewi: Abisirayeli babagenza nk’uk’ Uhoraho yari yarabariye Mose ku vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abalewi biyuhagira ivyaha, bamesura impuzu zabo; Aroni abatanga kw ishikanwa rijungujwe imbere y’Uhoraho, kand’ abatangira impongano ngo bahumanuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo Abalewi babona kuza gukora ibikorwa vyabo vy’ ihema ry’ibonaniro, bagabga na Aroni n’abana biwe; ivy’ Abalewi babigenza nk’uk’ Uhoraho yari yarabariye Mose ku vyabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
