        },
        {
          "text": "at’ Ibi ni vyo ngeze ku Balewi: abamaze imyaka mirongwibiri n’ itanu no kuja hejuru baze binjire mw ibango ry’igikorwa c’ihema ry’ ibonaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
