              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bageza imyaka mirongwitanu baze bakūkuruke mur’ iryo bango ry’ico gikorwa, ntibasubire gukora nk’ ababibazwa; ",
          "type": "text",
